BT 1 0 0 1 0 19.8 Tm /F2 12.2 Tf 16 TL (Q23. UPI payments may peak at 4,000 transactions per second. The vendor) Tj T* (proposes MySQL MyISAM because it is faster for reads. Write the response.) Tj T* ET
