BT 1 0 0 1 0 35.8 Tm /F2 12.2 Tf 16 TL -0.002278 Tw (Q25. During an incident review, a developer says: "The application logged 'transfer) Tj T* 0 Tw (successful', so the money must have moved." Explain why that statement is not) Tj T* (evidence, and state what would be.) Tj T* ET
