Q
q
1 0 0 1 57.02362 73.70079 cm
q
0 0 0 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 34.5 Tm /F1 10.5 Tf 15 TL (An application log only shows that the application wrote that message; it does not prove that the) Tj T* (database transaction committed. Evidence would be the committed database transaction, the resulting) Tj T* (account balances and the corresponding transaction records/reference.) Tj T* ET
