BT 1 0 0 1 0 19.8 Tm /F2 12.2 Tf 16 TL (Q26. The DBA proposes setting fsync = off on the core banking PostgreSQL server) Tj T* (because it makes overnight batch loads faster. Write a short recommendation.) Tj T* ET
