q
1 0 0 1 57.02362 704.7008 cm
q
BT 1 0 0 1 0 34.5 Tm 15 TL /F1 10.5 Tf 0 0 0 rg (I would not set ) Tj /F2 10.5 Tf (fsync = off) Tj /F1 10.5 Tf ( on the core banking server because it increases the risk of data loss or) Tj T* (corruption after a system failure. It may be used only in a disposable development or test environment) Tj T* (where the data can be recreated and the risk is understood.) Tj T* ET
