Q
q
1 0 0 1 57.02362 522.7008 cm
q
0 0 0 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 35.8 Tm /F2 12.2 Tf 16 TL (Q28. ICICI Bank is acquiring a smaller bank whose core system runs on) Tj T* (PostgreSQL, while ICICI runs Oracle. List four differences between the two) Tj T* (products that you would expect to cause problems during the merge.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 57.02362 441.7008 cm
q
BT 1 0 0 1 0 64.5 Tm 15 TL /F1 10.5 Tf 0 0 0 rg (1. ) Tj /F2 10.5 Tf (Data types:) Tj /F1 10.5 Tf ( PostgreSQL and Oracle have different type names and behaviour in some areas.) Tj  T* (2. ) Tj /F2 10.5 Tf (SQL syntax and functions:) Tj /F1 10.5 Tf ( date functions and other built-in functions can differ.) Tj  T* (3. ) Tj /F2 10.5 Tf (Procedural languages:) Tj /F1 10.5 Tf ( PostgreSQL PL/pgSQL and Oracle PL/SQL are different.) Tj  T* (4. ) Tj /F2 10.5 Tf (Database-specific features:) Tj /F1 10.5 Tf ( indexing, sequences/identity behaviour and other platform-specific) Tj T* (features may need changes.) Tj T* ET
